{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If there are visible or approached objects, scan for them. Then move or take them, check properties, perform tasks. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    />",
